  "title": "Nasty Roast Renkon-Lotus Root in Kadhai",
  "description": "A yeasty and fluffy Egyptian dish featuring roasted renkon-lotus root, perfect for a indulgent breakfast or light meal.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
