  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat Kadhai to medium-high heat.",
    "Peel and thinly slice the renkon-lotus root.",
    "Mince the garlic cloves and finely chop the ginger.",
    "Mix olive oil, minced garlic, chopped ginger, sesame seeds, salt, cayenne pepper, and coriander in a bowl.",
    "Toss sliced renkon-lotus root with the spice mixture until well coated.",
    "Spread the seasoned renkon-lotus root evenly on the Kadhai griddle or frying pan.",
    "Cook for about 20 minutes or until golden brown and crispy, turning once halfway through cooking time.",
    "Serve hot as a side dish or in wraps."
